<% provide(:title, 'Get Involved | Join the fight to help stop HB2 in the state of North Carolina') %>
<%= render partial: 'partials/pageTitle', locals: { title: 'Get Involved', desc: 'Join the fight to help stop HB2 in the state of North Carolina!' } %>
<br />
<div class="row">
  <div class="small-3 medium-2 columns">
    <img src="/images/contribute/vote.jpg" alt="Vote!" class="other-org__img" />
  </div>
  <div class="small-9 medium-10 columns">
    <h2>Vote</h2>
    <p>If you're an NC resident, this is the most important thing you could possibly do. <b>The deadline to register is Friday October 14th</b>. If you're not registered yet, <a href="https://register2.rockthevote.com/registrants/new/?state=NC" class="link" href="_blank">go do it now</a>!</p>
  </div>
</div>
<hr />
<div class="row">
  <div class="small-3 medium-2 columns">
    <img src="/images/contribute/eqnc.jpg" alt="Equality NC Logo" class="other-org__img" />
  </div>
  <div class="small-9 medium-10 columns">
    <h2>Donate</h2>
    <p><a href="https://equalitync.org/" class="link" target="_blank">Equality NC</a> is leading the way to equal rights in North Carolina, starting with ending HB2. If you want to donate money, <a href="https://equalitync.org/action/donate/" class="link" href="_blank">give it to them</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<hr />
<div class="row">
  <div class="small-3 medium-2 columns">
    <img src="/images/contribute/volunteer.jpg" alt="Hands raised in the air" class="other-org__img" />
  </div>
  <div class="small-9 medium-10 columns">
    <h2>Volunteer</h2>
    <p>There are lots of ways to help, starting with volunteering for <a href="https://equalitync.org/" class="link" target="_blank">Equality NC</a>, or <a href="http://turnoutnc.org/volunteer/" class="link" target="_blank">TurnOut! NC</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<hr />
<div class="row">
  <div class="small-12 columns">
    <small class="small">Not sure if you're ready to get involved yet? <a href="<%= losses_path %>" class="link">Check out the losses.</a></small>
  </div>
</div>
